<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 3 Best in Slot Gear list for Elemental Shaman DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, BoE World drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Elemental Shaman DPS in Phase 3</h2>Elemental <a class="icontiny c7" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/shaman">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_shaman.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shaman</span></a> Tier 9 set has a relatively weak set bonus but, more importantly, can be obtained at item level 258 and has great stats overall, making it an excellent investment for the pieces alone, with the set bonuses being the cherry on top.<br/>
<br/>There is no real point to making a full-Mail set because many slots force you to use low item level gear or gear with Mp5, which is very ineffective when compared to the options listed. Most of the gear <b>is</b> Mail, and we prefer to use it, as it is a mostly uncontested item category.<br/>
