<br/>Alternatively,  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47928/firestorm-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_57.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firestorm Ring</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48001/firestorm-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_57.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firestorm Band</span></a> are very strong, but might also overcap you on Hit, and you can temporarily use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47224/ring-of-the-darkmender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Darkmender</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47439/circle-of-the-darkmender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Circle of the Darkmender</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45614/starshine-circle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshine Circle</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45168/pyrelight-circle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pyrelight Circle</span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45451/frozen-loop">
