<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinket for Elemental Shaman DPS in Phase 3</h3>The new <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47188/reign-of-the-unliving">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reign of the Unliving</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47477/reign-of-the-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reign of the Dead</span></a> and old <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a> are the top trinkets, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47213/abyssal-rune">
